{"ordinal":13911,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343307","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_DontShoot_0a6c85a","source":"Fanatic: Ты просто пива мне дай.","target":"Fanatic: Dă-mi doar niște bere.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13912,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343306","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_DontShoot_08dfbb3","source":"Fanatic: Но если уж ты хочешь со мной больше общаться, не обязательно всматриваться в части тела.","target":"Fanatic: Dar dacă vrei să stai mai mult de vorbă cu mine, nu trebuie să-mi cercetezi părțile corpului.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13913,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343305","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_DontShoot_07d83d7","source":"Fanatic: А вообще я не понял, что ты там высматривал.","target":"Fanatic: Oricum, n-am înțeles la ce te uitai acolo.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13914,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343304","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_DontShoot_050e34c","source":"Fanatic: Другое дело твоё серое вещество! Оно должно стать жёлтым.","target":"Fanatic: Materia ta cenușie e altă poveste! Ea trebuie să devină galbenă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13915,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343303","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_DontShoot_0990fe2","source":"Fanatic: Уши ничего не значат!","target":"Fanatic: Urechile nu înseamnă nimic!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13916,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343302","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_DontShoot_07ebf28","source":"Fanatic: Вот это ты дал жару.","target":"Fanatic: Uite ce-ai făcut!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13917,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343301","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_DontShoot_030e6ba","source":"Fanatic: После этого я его не видел. Наконец, пошёл заниматься делом, а не хуйнёй, видимо.","target":"Fanatic: După asta nu l-am mai văzut. În sfârșit s-o fi apucat de ceva serios, nu de prostii de căcat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13918,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343300","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_DontShoot_0653aab","source":"Fanatic: Так внутри ведра создастся пивной угар, и можно получить силы Солнца!","target":"Fanatic: Așa, în găleată se adună aburii berii și poți căpăta puterea Soarelui!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13919,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343299","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_DontShoot_007ef1e","source":"Fanatic: И кричал вот так вот: УАААААААА.","target":"Fanatic: Și striga așa: UAAAAAAAAA.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13920,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343298","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_DontShoot_08852f0","source":"Fanatic: Даю ему ведро, говорю, чтобы дома покрасил в чёрный цвет, вышел на улицу с надетым на голову ведром.","target":"Fanatic: Îi dau o găleată, îi spun s-o vopsească acasă în negru, apoi să iasă afară cu găleata pe cap.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13921,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343297","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_DontShoot_0dd5aac","source":"Fanatic: Я ему сразу сказал: СОЛНЦЕ НЕ ТРОНЕТ ТЕБЯ! Но ты слабачок,сейчас научу тебя трюку.","target":"Fanatic: I-am spus imediat: SOARELE NU TE VA ATINGE! Dar tu ești un slăbănog, așa că acum îți arăt un truc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13922,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452652343296","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_DontShoot_067a4f0","source":"Fanatic: Приходит ко мне хиленький мужичок. Рассказывает, что хочет понять, как спасаться от Солнца.","target":"Fanatic: Vine la mine un tip firav. Îmi spune că vrea să afle cum să se apere de Soare.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13923,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648149003","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_DontShoot_009ce6f","source":"Fanatic: Ну, есть история, как я учил солнечного лидера принимать силу Солнца.","target":"Fanatic: Ei bine, îți pot povesti cum l-am învățat pe liderul solar să primească puterea Soarelui.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13924,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648149002","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_Gun_0a9ef5b","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13925,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648149001","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_Gun_0420112","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13926,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648149000","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_Gun_022ad2a","source":"Fanatic: Ты же не вонючий подземник, правильно? ЗАЧЕМ ВЕДЁШЬ СЕБЯ, КАК ОНИ?","target":"Fanatic: Doar nu ești unul dintre împuțiții de sub pământ, nu? ATUNCI DE CE TE PORȚI CA EI?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13927,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648148999","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_Gun_03a2ecd","source":"Fanatic: ВОТ ЭТО НИХУЯ СЕБЕ!","target":"Fanatic: SĂ-MI BAG PICIOARELE!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13928,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648148998","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_Gun_00c1272","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13929,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648148997","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_Gun_0b75c63","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13930,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648148996","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_Gun_08f03c4","source":"Fanatic: Так что давай-ка ты уберёшь вот это вот своё агрессивное и послушаешь меня.","target":"Fanatic: Așa că lasă agresivitatea asta și ascultă-mă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13931,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648148995","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_Gun_092ae2b","source":"Fanatic: Я должен принимать пиво, чтобы Солнце не жгло меня.","target":"Fanatic: Trebuie să beau bere ca să nu mă ardă Soarele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13932,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648148994","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_Gun_0915a19","source":"Fanatic: Это моя пивная аура, да.","target":"Fanatic: E aura mea de bere, da.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13933,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648148993","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_Gun_0648ead","source":"Fanatic: Меня охлаждает само СОЛНЦЕ! Оно не даст мне сгореть в его праведном свету... свете... ты понял, короче.","target":"Fanatic: Însuși SOARELE mă răcorește! N-o să mă lase să ard în lumina lui dreaptă... dreptă... știi tu ce vreau să spun.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13934,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452648148992","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_Gun_057c88d","source":"Fanatic: А ну стоять, умалишённый!","target":"Fanatic: Stai pe loc, nebunule!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13935,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452643954698","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_0c240d3","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13936,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452643954697","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_0c9c959","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13937,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452643954696","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_05fb7ab","source":"Fanatic: Мозг обрабатывает энергию и даёт мне силы противостоять ГАДКИМ УБЛЮДКАМ ПОД ЗЕМЛЁЙ!","target":"Fanatic: Creierul prelucrează energia și-mi dă puterea să țin piept NEMERNICILOR ĂLORA SCÂRBOȘI DE SUB PĂMÂNT!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13938,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452643954695","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_0f7f601","source":"Fanatic: Это переработанный солнечный свет льётся из ГОЛОВЫ!","target":"Fanatic: Lumina Soarelui, prelucrată, îmi curge din CAP!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13939,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452643954694","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_0c01099","source":"Fanatic: ...","target":"Fanatic: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13940,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452643954693","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Ears_0fe5094","source":"Fanatic: Да, я принимаю в уши сигналы ЖИЗНИ! Как ты узнал?","target":"Fanatic: Da, primesc prin urechi semnalele VIEȚII! De unde ai știut?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13941,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452643954692","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_0db3fe0","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
