{"ordinal":13943,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452643954690","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_05c8078","source":"Fanatic: ЭТО ЖЕ НА СПАСЕНИЕ ЭНЕРГИИ СОЛНЦА!","target":"Fanatic: ASTA-I PENTRU SALVAREA ENERGIEI SOARELUI!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13944,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452643954689","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_061464c","source":"Fanatic: А ты мне за это дашь немного денег.","target":"Fanatic: Iar tu îmi dai niște bani pentru asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13945,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452643954688","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_0a97f54","source":"Fanatic: Приходи ко мне, буду рассказывать свое житие-бытие.","target":"Fanatic: Vino la mine și-am să-ți povestesc despre viața mea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13946,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452639760394","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_01acaf9","source":"Fanatic: КАК ЖЕ ПРЕКРАСНО ВСЁ ПОЛУЧИЛОСЬ!","target":"Fanatic: CE MINUNAT A IEȘIT TOTUL!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13947,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452639760393","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_05761d7","source":"Fanatic: ...","target":"Fanatic: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13948,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452639760392","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_0f5d103","source":"Fanatic: Давай, ФОТКАЙ МЕНЯ!","target":"Fanatic: Hai, FĂ-MI O POZĂ!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13949,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452639760391","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_0c7d673","source":"Fanatic: Да, я учил его смотреть на солнце, но это я как-нибудь потом расскажу.","target":"Fanatic: Da, eu l-am învățat să privească Soarele, dar despre asta îți povestesc altă dată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13950,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452639760390","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fanatic_Photo_0397c21","source":"Fanatic: Тебе кто-то рассказал, что я здоровался с самим СОЛНЕЧНЫМ ЛИДЕРОМ?","target":"Fanatic: Ți-a spus cineva că l-am salutat chiar pe LIDERUL SOLAR?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-356.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
